ad over its districts in line with each district's early-vote party mix (3%). Updated every 10 minutes from the county TQV feeds and Broward's turnout dashboard."},"election_day_mix":{"exact":1494630,"split":77653,"unmatched":66408,"estimated":45310},"election_day_as_of":"2026-11-03T19:50:23Z","data_hash":"7b095018f342a749510e7751e91c07fb9e34dcfc7248857c7a0ddc65479cb364","generated_at":"2026-11-03T19:50:29Z"}